{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "84815161-dbcd-8fd9-8c65-1dc136387f30",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T11:23:29-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Amaral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:21:08-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:21:13-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Jorge Amaral. I am calling about a noise problem. The restaurant next door to my building has a heating and cooling unit on the roof, and it is very loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:21:25-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Where is the building, Mr. Amaral?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:21:29-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 176 Rhode Island Avenue, on the Hill. I am the property manager there. The unit is running day and night. It [inaudible] since the weekend, since Saturday morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:21:39-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since Saturday, okay. I'm sorry, you cut out a little there. Did you say it runs through the night too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:21:46-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. All night. The tenants cannot sleep. I called the restaurant on Sunday and nobody answered. I am calling now because this is the second day and nothing has changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:21:56-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. That's a rough couple of nights for everybody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:22:00-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. So my question is precise. Should I call the police non-emergency line instead of you? I do not want to use the wrong office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:22:09-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. For something happening right now at night, the non-emergency line is usually the quicker way to get someone out. But I can also write this up so it's on record here. Let me take down the details, and you can do both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:22:23-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Please write it. Also there is another matter, if you allow. The apartment next door to the restaurant keeps getting deliveries for someone else. Packages, food orders, they come to the wrong door. I think it is the same business, but I am not certain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:22:38-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, that one I don't think we handle here, that's more between the post office or the delivery company and the business. But I'll put it in the notes so it's connected to the complaint."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:22:50-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please put it. [line breaks up] ...the tenants are tired of carrying them over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:22:55-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're breaking up on me. Can I get a number in case I lose you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:23:00-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0155."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:23:02-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0155. And it's the restaurant's rooftop unit, at 176 Rhode Island Avenue, running since Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:23:08-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. That is exact. I expect someone to look at it this week. Two days is already too long."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:23:15-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll get this to the right people today, and I'd call the police line tonight if it's still going."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:23:23-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you, Sandra. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:23:26-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Amaral. Take care."
    }
  ],
